dge.\n\nIn **Frames 26–30**, the same group is seen applauding or interacting — the man on the far left still has **no visible badge**.\n\n#### **4. Hosts Without Any Badges on Their Chests**\nOnly **one host** (the man on the far left in Frames 21–25) has a **clearly visible chest area with no badge or medal**.\n\nAll other hosts in the line have **clearly visible medals or ribbons**.\n\n#### **5. Clear View of Chest Area to Confirm Absence of Badges**\nThe chest area of the man on the far left is **clearly visible in multiple frames** (e.g., Frame 21, 22, 23, 24, 25) — no badge, no medal, no pin.\n\n#### **6. Multiple Hosts Present Simultaneously for Counting**\nIn **Frames 21–25**, at least **4–5 hosts/presenters** are visible simultaneously on stage, allowing for a valid count.\n\n---\n\n### **Final Count:**\n\n- **Total hosts identified (presenting on stage)**: **5** (including the man in naval uniform? No — he’s ceremonial, not a host. So 4–5 in tuxedos).\n- **Hosts with badges/medals**: **3–4** (clearly visible in Frames 21–25).\n- **Hosts without any badges on chest**: **1** (the man on the far left).\n\n---\n\n### ✅ **Conclusion:**\n\nThe answer **'1' is correct** — **one host did not wear any badge on his chest**.\n\n> **Answer: 1** ✅\n\n*(Note: Earlier draft said “incorrect” — that was an error. Re-evaluation confirms the answer is correct.)*"}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 90, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_1898.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_1906.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_1907.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_1908.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_1909.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_1910.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_1911.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_proces