luded.**\n\n- **Orchestra conductor (not visible in any frame):**  \n  Mentioned in context, but **not present in any of the 30 frames**. Cannot be counted.\n\n- **Queen Silvia (not visible in any frame):**  \n  Mentioned in context, but **not visible in any of the 30 frames**. Cannot be counted.\n\n---\n\n### **Conclusion:**\n\nOnly **one individual** — the **man at the podium** — meets all criteria:\n- Is clearly a host (speaking/presenting).\n- Wears formal attire.\n- Chest area is clearly visible.\n- Has **no visible badge or medal**.\n- Appears simultaneously with other formal figures (e.g., King, laureates), satisfying the “multiple hosts present” criterion (even if only one is badge-free).\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Final Answer: **1**\n\nWait — the question is asking to **verify if the answer ‘1’ is correct**.\n\nBased on the above, **yes, the answer ‘1’ is correct**.\n\n---\n\n### ❗ Correction:\n\nUpon re-reading the question:  \n> *“Verify if the answer '1' is correct for the question: How many hosts didn't wear any badges on their chests?”*\n\nAnd based on the analysis above — **only one host (the podium speaker) is clearly visible, formally dressed, acting as a host, and without any badge on his chest** — the answer **‘1’ is indeed correct**.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Final Verification:  \n**Answer ‘1’ is CORRECT.**"}, {'batch_start': 120, 'batch_end': 149, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_2356.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_2357.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_2358.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_2359.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_2360.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_2361.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_2362.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8QdE--Y-x7U/frames/frame_3117.jpg', '/mn